
== 0. Prasyarat + preflight (tanpa perintah mutating)
.env tidak ditemukan — memakai password default compose. Bila stack lama memakai password kustom, langkah 0b akan gagal; isi .env dulu.
  project lama: umnia-legacy (normalisasi: umnia-legacy)
  project baru: umnia (normalisasi: umnia)
  > docker compose -f /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy config -q
  file compose lama valid: /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml
  target fresh: tidak ada container/volume umnia
  sumber: volume umnia-legacy_postgres-business-data ada

== 0b. Jalankan postgres lama dan verifikasi identitas sumber
  postgres lama berhenti — start non-destruktif untuk verifikasi identitas
  > docker compose -f /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy up -d postgres-business
  identitas sumber OK: current_user=umnia_business, tabel workspaces ada
  sumber: container deadbeef0001, volume legacy-old_postgres-business-data

== 0c. Maintenance: hentikan penulis sebelum dump
  penulis tidak berjalan (dilewati): business-api
  > docker compose -f /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy stop web
  penulis dihentikan: web
  penulis berhenti: tidak ada sesi aktif umnia_business

== 1. Dump database lama (custom format, --no-owner)
  > docker compose -f /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy exec -T postgres-business pg_dump -U umnia_business -d umnia_business --no-owner -Fc -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump

== 2. Salin backup keluar (docker cp, binary-safe)
  > docker cp deadbeef0001:/tmp/umnia-backup.dump /tmp/umnia-upg-stopsrc-10aa2c69/backups/umnia-backup-20261106-020326.dump

== 3. Validasi backup SEBELUM menghentikan stack lama
  ukuran backup: 31651 byte
  pg_restore -l OK (memuat tabel workspaces)
  > docker compose -f /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy exec -T postgres-business rm -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump

== 4. Hentikan stack lama (volume DIPERTAHANKAN, tanpa -v)
  > docker compose -f /tmp/umnia legacy/stopsrc/compose.yml -p umnia-legacy down

== 5. Jalankan postgres project baru (volume kosong -> initdb)
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia up -d postgres-business

== 6. Restore backup ke database baru
  > docker cp /tmp/umnia-upg-stopsrc-10aa2c69/backups/umnia-backup-20261106-020326.dump cafef00d0002:/tmp/umnia-backup.dump
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia exec -T postgres-business pg_restore -U umnia_bootstrap -d umnia_business --no-owner --exit-on-error /tmp/umnia-backup.dump
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia exec -T postgres-business rm -f /tmp/umnia-backup.dump

== 7. Jalankan stack baru penuh (migrate menormalkan kepemilikan)
  > docker compose -f /home/hatch/workspace/UMNIA-APP/deploy/windows/compose.yml -p umnia up --build -d

== 8a. Verifikasi database
  role f/f OK, 002_identity OK, EXECUTE 12/12 OK

== 8b. Verifikasi API (read-only: /readyz + hitung workspaces)
  [http] GET http://127.0.0.1:18081/readyz -> 200
  /readyz 200 OK, workspaces hasil restore: 1 (read-only; tidak ada akun/workspace tes yang dibuat)
